[Options]

[A.]
<h2>Warm south wind</h2>
<i>"Wind is what makes the world go round"<br>
-- Windrak Duban, High Priest</i>  
<p>While traveling south to face the Wind Lord you encounter his guards.  There is a slight problem...one of them is in control of a large deposit of storm power!

<?!{atweapon0}>$Button=Prepare,Tell,OldTech</?>
<?{atweapon0}>$Button=Review Knowledge,ShowTechnology,55</?>
$Button=Play Mission,DoNothing,0
$Button=Finished,Tell,objective1

